[PrintTextModified Text:呜……呜呜……|#0204Adv14_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我……我怎么会做出那样的事……<br>居然杀了艾玛，杀了艾玛啊……|#0204Adv14_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:像是在发自心底地痛悔，<br>跪倒在地的汉娜不断流着悔恨的泪水。|#0204Adv14_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜呜……<br>不管受到怎样的责难，我也无话可说……|#0204Adv14_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为我亲手杀死了<br>重要的朋友，艾玛……|#0204Adv14_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

