[PrintTextModified Text:面对抽泣不止的汉娜，<br>我们照例被典狱长催促，<br>被迫作出执行处刑的选择。|#0204Adv14_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（汉娜是杀害艾玛和蕾雅的魔女。<br>　被处刑也是理所当然）|#0204Adv14_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（根本不可能会、有理由犹豫……）|#0204Adv14_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而我的指尖却不由得迟疑。|#0204Adv14_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

