@Wait WaitMode:0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:……汉娜。<br>你可以回答我一个问题吗。|#0204Adv14_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:途中，雪莉静静地开口说道。|#0204Adv14_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜表情一紧，回头看向雪莉。|#0204Adv14_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:什么事呢，雪莉……<br>我已经没有什么话要说了。|#0204Adv14_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经犯了罪……会坦然接受惩罚的。|#0204Adv14_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜用颤抖的声音说完，转过身，<br>再度朝处刑台走去。|#0204Adv14_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你为什么要杀蕾雅？|#0204Adv14_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在她背后，雪莉依然还在追问。<br>那语气似乎带着一种拼命恳求。|#0204Adv14_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女的杀意使你发自内心要杀的对象，<br>其实不是艾玛，而是蕾雅，对吗？<br>你的动机是什么？|#0204Adv14_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0204Adv14_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的背影微微一颤。|#0204Adv14_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_42_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我和汉娜在一起的时间最久了，<br>现在渐渐能够稍微理解一点<br>你的心情……|#0204Adv14_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜其实<br>一直都很讨厌蕾雅吧。<br>或许从第一次见面时，就已经……|#0204Adv14_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这种心情随着魔女化进程加剧，<br>慢慢膨胀成了杀意<br>我也能理解。|#0204Adv14_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……从第一次见面时，就已经？）|#0204Adv14_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果说汉娜从一开始就对蕾雅<br>怀着深深的自卑。|#0204Adv14_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果说，汉娜心中的阴影在初见蕾雅时业已诞生，<br>一点一点地在心中生根发芽，<br>终有一天化为杀意——|#0204Adv14_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那样的话，就——）|#0204Adv14_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:重来也无济于事。|#0204Adv14_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当意识到这个事实时，<br>我心中仿佛有什么轰然崩塌。|#0204Adv14_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:强烈的冲击<br>让我不禁按住胸口缩成一团。|#0204Adv14_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:小希！？<br>你怎么了，你没事吧！？|#0204Adv14_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……没事。<br>我要亲眼见证到最后。|#0204Adv14_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:膝盖在颤抖，我却还是设法站了起来。|#0204Adv14_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在晃动的视野角落，<br>看见雪莉向前探出了身子。|#0204Adv14_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:1.6 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Cry1,ArmR4 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:……你可能不想说出来。<br>但我真的，很想知道。|#0204Adv14_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想知道汉娜真正的心。<br>我还想更了解你一点。|#0204Adv14_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉的声音<br>比以往任何时候都更加颤抖。|#0204Adv14_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:颤抖得仿佛随时会哭出来。|#0204Adv14_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:求求你了，汉娜……|#0204Adv14_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……为什么。|#0204Adv14_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜没有回头，<br>只是肩膀轻轻颤抖，挤出沙哑的声音。|#0204Adv14_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么你总是这样……<br>总是不顾一切、<br>大摇大摆地闯入我的内心深处？|#0204Adv14_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

