[PrintTextModified Text:沙漏下方装有一道门。<br>看守将那道门打开。|#0204Adv14_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜被看守推入了沙漏中。|#0204Adv14_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

