; ＠備考◆倒れる

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0204Adv14_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守站到门前时，<br>岩石开始下落了。|#0204Adv14_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:470_3

; パラパラと石が落ちてくる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_149 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:在毫不留情地砸下的岩石雨中，<br>倒地的汉娜踉跄坐起身来。|#0204Adv14_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她坐在地上，<br>视线穿过玻璃，看向我们。|#0204Adv14_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2.8 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30,30 AppearanceAndTransition:470_3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……没错，没错，你说得对。<br>我，憎恨着蕾雅。|#0204Adv14_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我心里一直都不喜欢她。<br>尽管如此，我还是在努力<br>想要与她好好相处……|#0204Adv14_Hanna012| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果当时蕾雅<br>不说出那句话——|#0204Adv14_Hanna013| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

