[PrintTextModified Text:那是我正准备回到地面，<br>刚走进电梯的时候。|#0204Adv14_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:偶然遇上了蕾雅。|#0204Adv14_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我们乘上了电梯，就这样一同上升。|#0204Adv14_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:那时我怀里抱着一块冰。|#0204Adv14_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为雪莉在玩什么踢冰球，<br>地上到处散落着冰块，太危险了。于是我就打算把冰块收拾起来。|#0204Adv14_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:之前聊过想让安安穿上舞台服，这件事你还记得吗？|#0204Adv14_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她突然主动开口，<br>谈起舞台服的事。|#0204Adv14_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当大家决定要一起探索地下设施时，<br>我脑海中最先浮现的，是安安。|#0204Adv14_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我知道安安的遗体<br>还在地下设施里。<br>我想至少……替她好好打扮一下。|#0204Adv14_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是我去画室，<br>把舞台服带了出来。|#0204Adv14_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后就被蕾雅撞见了。|#0204Adv14_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的心意真的太美好了。<br>可以的话，我也想加入。|#0204Adv14_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅从包里拿出一样东西给我看。<br>那是主角戴的王冠。|#0204Adv14_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想，在她面前，<br>上演一场真正的舞台剧。|#0204Adv14_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她露出了一丝恶作剧般的笑，<br>而那时，我只是别开了视线。|#0204Adv14_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:不过话说回来，汉娜……<br>你的手，怎么弄得这么粗糙了啊。|#0204Adv14_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你还是不要再继续洗衣服了。|#0204Adv14_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么……？|#0204Adv14_Hanna014| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说实话，我不太懂你为什么每天都在洗衣服。|#0204Adv14_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她露出似乎有些不知所措的笑容。<br>就在那一刻，电梯抵达了地面。|#0204Adv14_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那不经意的一句话，即使没有恶意，<br>却无声地刺进了我心底深藏的情绪。|#0204Adv14_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……不会懂的。|#0204Adv14_Hanna015| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？|#0204Adv14_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我紧紧咬住了嘴唇。|#0204Adv14_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:生活在跟我不同世界的你，<br>怎么可能会懂……！|#0204Adv14_Hanna016| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……哈啊、哈啊……|#0204Adv14_Hanna017| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，我太激动了。<br>可以等我平复一下吗。|#0204Adv14_Hanna018| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:扔下这句话后，我低下头，紧张地喘着气。<br>不知那时蕾雅心里究竟在想什么。<br>她再也不发一言了。|#0204Adv14_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是感到恐惧？<br>还是觉得我很吓人？<br>又或是——同情？|#0204Adv14_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不好意思，那我【先走一步】了。|#0204Adv14_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:【先走一步】。<br>这句话一举把我的心逼入绝境。|#0204Adv14_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:随之而来的是巨大的焦虑感。|#0204Adv14_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……哈啊、哈啊……！|#0204Adv14_Hanna019| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——果然，我和她，所在的世界天差地别。|#0204Adv14_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她总是独自一人，<br>走向光彩夺目的那一边。|#0204Adv14_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——扔下我一个。|#0204Adv14_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……为什么要扔下我？<br>可不可以不要——抛弃悲惨的我。|#0204Adv14_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆大きく息を吸う

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0204Adv14_Hanna020| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 殴るSE

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:瞬间的冲动闪过。我抡起了手中的冰块<br>狠狠砸向蕾雅的后脑。|#0204Adv14_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:紧接着，电梯门打开了……|#0204Adv14_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:咦……？|#0204Adv14_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:电梯门外站着呆住的艾玛——|#0204Adv14_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@HideActors ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle Lazy:false

; ========================================
; 回想ここまで
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2.8 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30,30 AppearanceAndTransition:470_4 SubId:Middle

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:我嫉妒蕾雅、羡慕蕾雅、渴望成为蕾雅、<br>渴望着、渴望着、渴望着……|#0204Adv14_Hanna021| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无论我怎样祈求，<br>都无法触及她所在的那片天地。|#0204Adv14_Hanna022| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:意识到我终究会被抛弃时……|#0204Adv14_Hanna023| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真的好悲惨。|#0204Adv14_Hanna024| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2.8 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30,30 AppearanceAndTransition:470_5 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:所以，<br>我杀了蕾雅。|#0204Adv14_Hanna025| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜她——一边流泪，一边讥笑着。|#0204Adv14_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2.8 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30,30 AppearanceAndTransition:470_6 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:这人真是烂透了，对不对？<br>自己这个样子，本来是、不想让任何人知道的……|#0204Adv14_Hanna026| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:隔着玻璃，眼睁睁看着<br>她的脸逐渐龟裂开来。|#0204Adv14_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:落石无数次殴打她的身体，<br>仿佛正从伤口中不断流出鲜血。|#0204Adv14_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可那不是血，是更深更深的某物。|#0204Adv14_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]


[PrintTextModified Text:黢黑的裂痕发出锐声，<br>不断蔓延，直至彻底覆盖她的脸。|#0204Adv14_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:我们终究<br>窥见了汉娜内心深处阴影下的【禁忌】。|#0204Adv14_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@StopBgm

