@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Simple MakeDefault:true HideOther:true

[PrintTextModified Text:——我曾梦过一场短暂的梦。|#0204Adv14_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有一天，远野汉娜在垃圾场捡到了<br>一套被当作可回收垃圾丢弃的少女漫画。|#0204Adv14_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在照料年幼妹妹的间隙空暇，只要翻开这套书，<br>汉娜就感觉自己仿佛成了书里的大小姐。|#0204Adv14_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要翻开一页，<br>就能迎来一瞬美梦。<br>这成了汉娜的日常。|#0204Adv14_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这段充满小小梦境的日子里，<br>某一天，汉娜意识到自己拥有魔法。|#0204Adv14_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:能够稍微浮在空中的魔法。|#0204Adv14_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——和漫画里的女主角一样。|#0204Adv14_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我，是特别的。|#0204Adv14_Narrative071| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我，是被选中的人。|#0204Adv14_Narrative072| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:终于轮到我了，汉娜想。<br>终于有出头之日了。|#0204Adv14_Narrative073| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梦想像气球一样越胀越大。|#0204Adv14_Narrative074| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜每天夜里跑出家门，<br>偷偷练习飞行。|#0204Adv14_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无论酷暑严寒，<br>无论风雨交加。|#0204Adv14_Narrative076| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:坚信自己一定能飞向更高的天空。|#0204Adv14_Narrative077| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:4.5 Duration:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:-100,90 AppearanceAndTransition:170_1

[PrintTextModified Text:那是寒冬里的一天。<br>大雪静静纷飞。|#0204Adv14_Narrative078| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是稍微跑出去一会。<br>平常也是这样的。<br>今天一定也没事。|#0204Adv14_Narrative079| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:今天好像又比昨天飞得高了1毫米。<br>一定是练习有了成效。|#0204Adv14_Narrative080| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜带着满足的笑容回到家时。|#0204Adv14_Narrative081| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:终于发现<br>妹妹正发着高烧。|#0204Adv14_Narrative082| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:家里没有电话。汉娜连钱包都忘了带，一心拼命跑到医院。|#0204Adv14_Narrative083| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2 Duration:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:100,80 AppearanceAndTransition:170_1 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:10 ScenePositionY:30 Scale:2 EasingTypeName:Linear Duration:20

[PrintTextModified Text:太愚蠢了。<br>悔恨的巨浪将她吞没，<br>却再没有人给她任何一句安慰。|#0204Adv14_Narrative084| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——你是姐姐。<br>你要负起责任，好好照顾弟妹。|#0204Adv14_Narrative085| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:母亲抛弃她时留下的那句话，<br>在脑中一次又一次回响。|#0204Adv14_Narrative086| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——这只是一场短暂的梦。|#0204Adv14_Narrative087| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——妹妹没有死，<br>母亲也没有抛弃我们。|#0204Adv14_Narrative088| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我们才不会被抛弃。<br>|#0204Adv14_Narrative089| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我们住在又有钱又温暖的家里，<br>过着大小姐般的生活。|#0204Adv14_Narrative090| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——破旧的小屋。|#0204Adv14_Narrative091| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——褴褛的衣衫。|#0204Adv14_Narrative092| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——刺骨的风雪。|#0204Adv14_Narrative093| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——死亡。|#0204Adv14_Narrative094| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:170_1 SubId:Front
@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:——好希望这一切全部、全部都只是一场梦。|#0204Adv14_Narrative095| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@HidePrinter

