@Wait WaitMode:1

; 激しい落石の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_150 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:470_6 SubId:Middle
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Default MakeDefault:true HideOther:true

[PrintTextModified Text:落石越滚越快，<br>纷纷砸在汉娜身上。|#0204Adv14_Narrative096| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_43_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:呃啊……啊啊啊！|#0204Adv14_Hanna027| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的腿折断成奇异的角度，<br>再也无法站立，逐渐失去力气瘫坐在地上。|#0204Adv14_Narrative097| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她喘着粗气，<br>拖着一条鲜红的血迹，<br>一点一点爬向玻璃壁。|#0204Adv14_Narrative098| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:470_7 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:因为嫉妒而杀人……<br>真是肮脏、丑陋、可耻至极……|#0204Adv14_Hanna028| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我知道自己罪该如此！<br>但是、但是……！|#0204Adv14_Hanna029| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在巨石不断堆积的沙漏里，<br>汉娜一次又一次用拳头砸向玻璃。|#0204Adv14_Narrative099| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2.8 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30,30 AppearanceAndTransition:470_7 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:但是……但是，我，<br>我真的不想变成魔女……|#0204Adv14_Hanna030| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算这么肮脏，<br>罪孽这么深重，还是想作为一个人……|#0204Adv14_Hanna031| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2.8 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30,30 AppearanceAndTransition:470_8 SubId:Forefront

[PrintTextModified Text:拜托了，在我还是人的时候杀了我吧——！|#0204Adv14_Hanna032| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要把我变成怪物啊！<br>就算死我也想保持自己还是人的样子！|#0204Adv14_Hanna033| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们目睹这悲惨的光景，<br>甚至不敢呼吸。|#0204Adv14_Narrative100| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那灵魂的呐喊、悲痛的祈求——<br>再无人能回应。|#0204Adv14_Narrative101| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，与汉娜的愿望背道而驰的是，<br>她正肉眼可见地急速化作残骸。|#0204Adv14_Narrative102| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在此时。|#0204Adv14_Narrative103| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Forefront,Stills-Front,Stills-Middle,Stills Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我全都理解了！|#0204Adv14_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉一声高喊，<br>让原本只能痛苦地注视着处刑的我<br>猛然回过神来。|#0204Adv14_Narrative104| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我看向雪莉，<br>只见她正以惊人的速度冲向那座沙漏。|#0204Adv14_Narrative105| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:小莉！？|#0204Adv14_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你在想什么——！|#0204Adv14_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:沙漏的门前站着看守。<br>而猛然飞冲上前的雪莉——|#0204Adv14_Narrative106| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ぶんっと武器が振り下ろされる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_9 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

; ざんっと肉が切れる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_12 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.8

[PrintTextModified Text:被看守的镰刀斩下。|#0204Adv14_Narrative107| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉！！|#0204Adv14_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然侥幸避开了致命处，<br>鲜血却从她的身体喷涌而出。|#0204Adv14_Narrative108| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜啊啊啊啊啊啊！！<br>啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！|#0204Adv14_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ざんっと肉が切れる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_12 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.8

[PrintTextModified Text:然而雪莉并没有停下脚步。<br>不论被看守的镰刀斩击多少次，<br>她依旧奋力冲进了沙漏下方的门。|#0204Adv14_Narrative109| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:滚落的巨岩几乎快要把汉娜掩埋。<br>重伤的汉娜只是呆望着这一切。|#0204Adv14_Narrative110| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2.8 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30,30 AppearanceAndTransition:470_8
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你到底要干什么啊！？|#0204Adv14_Hanna034| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉浑身是血，<br>一边奋力拨开岩石，一边朝汉娜靠近。|#0204Adv14_Narrative111| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:落石仍然一刻不停砸向两人。|#0204Adv14_Narrative112| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然你说不想被抛弃，<br>那我们就一起走吧！|#0204Adv14_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有我陪着你！所以汉娜，你已经没事了！<br>我不会抛弃你，<br>更不会让你被人抛弃！|#0204Adv14_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:470_9 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:绝对不会让你变成残骸！|#0204Adv14_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哪怕浑身是血，雪莉依旧灿烂地笑着，<br>向汉娜伸出颤抖的手。|#0204Adv14_Narrative113| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的五官痛苦地皱成一团。|#0204Adv14_Narrative114| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:470_10 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:你到底、到底有多傻啊——|#0204Adv14_Hanna035| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 激しい落石の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_150 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:巨岩即将把两人彻底吞没之际，<br>汉娜牵起雪莉的手，轻轻笑了。|#0204Adv14_Narrative115| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那一刻，<br>我窥见汉娜的脸上的裂痕尽数消失，<br>像是恢复了原本的模样。|#0204Adv14_Narrative116| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

