[PrintTextModified Text:沙漏上部的大量巨岩<br>尽数倾注而下——|#0204Adv14_Narrative117| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:高耸的岩石堆底，<br>两人的身影被完全碾碎，就此消失。|#0204Adv14_Narrative118| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

