[PrintTextModified Text:从岩缝中缓缓渗出的鲜红，<br>逐渐化作绚烂红蝶翩翩飞去。|#0204Adv14_Narrative119| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:许久以后，<br>也不曾传来残骸的咆哮声……|#0204Adv14_Narrative120| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:处刑台缓缓降入地底。|#0204Adv14_Narrative121| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

